{"id":"chuma","lemma":"чума","pos":"noun","rank":3892,"glosses":["plague, pestilence","the plague, the Black Death"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/86/Ru-%D1%87%D1%83%D0%BC%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%87%D1%83%D0%BC%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"чумы"},"examples":[{"text":"Тысячи людей умерли во время чумы.","en":"Thousands of people died during the plague.","words":[{"g":"set of thousand","l":"тысяча"},{"g":"people, humans","l":"люди"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"during"]]},{"text":"Чума опустошала целые города.","en":"The plague has devastated entire cities.","words":[null,null,{"g":"whole, entire","l":"целый"},{"g":"city, town","l":"город"}]},{"text":"Избегай Тома как чумы.","en":"Avoid Tom like the plague.","words":[{"g":"to avoid","l":"избегать"},{"g":"volume","l":"том"},{"g":"how / like"},null]},{"text":"Том избегает меня как чумы с тех пор, как одолжил у меня машину.","en":"Tom has been avoiding me like the plague ever since he borrowed my car.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to avoid","l":"избегать"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"how / like"},null,null,null,null,null,{"g":"to lend","l":"одолжить"},{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null],"phrases":[[5,9,"since"]]},{"text":"Люди почему-то бегут от меня как от чумы с того самого времени, как я вернулся из Индии.","en":"For some reason, people have been avoiding me like the plague ever since I got back from India.","words":[{"g":"people, humans"},{"g":"why"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to run, to be running","l":"бежать"},{"g":"from"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"from"},null,{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"self, -self","l":"сам"},{"g":"time","l":"время"},{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to return","l":"вернуться"},{"g":"from / out of"},null]}]}